    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__GLTreatment__c records where one of credit or debit GL account is mapped but the other is null.
Why it matters: The double-entry posting can&apos;t balance — one side has nowhere to land. Postings either error or end up in a suspense account that finance has to manually reconcile.
Suppress a finding: rare — almost always a half-finished configuration.
Disable the detector: only if your GL framework intentionally posts single-sided entries. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
